      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOLO VEGA (5) has been thereabouts in three runs back, the latest a fast-finishing fourth in a similar race last time. Should be at top and expected to feature in a weak race. BARNEY ROMMEL (1) has been freshened since being safely held over a little further last time. That was a strong form race and with the claim here gets a chance to atone. HEAVENLY RAPTURE (6) is fitter for two runs back and should be ready to show form. Was competitive in stakes class as a filly in some of the middle-distance races so has the ability. SECRETCHINO (4) got off the mark with an on-speed maiden win last time. Has upside and may pay to follow. AH KUM (7) boxed on well for fourth in similar company last time and is worth including.",
